      "translation": {
        "english_lines": [
          "1.",
          "Seeking, saying there are a thousand gods,",
          "you fools who wander—through many",
          "thousands of Vedas, that knowledge alone is God,",
          "have you not heard?",
          "2.",
          "Praising Maadan, Kaadan and Vedan,",
          "you witless ones who wander in delusion—within whatever",
          "stands and rises, that knowledge alone is God—",
          "have you not learned what was proclaimed?",
          "3.",
          "Slowly gathering and nurturing many gods,",
          "adding empty tales—and many",
          "false religions to spread—can you devise a method",
          "and show it?"
        ],
        "line_map": [
