            "english": "Seeking, saying there are a thousand gods,"
          },
          {
            "ordinal": 2,
            "kind": "lyric-line",
            "pdf_page": 16,
            "tamil": "அலையும் அறிவிலிகாள்—பல",
            "english": "you fools who wander—through many"
          },
