            "ordinal": 3,
            "kind": "lyric-line",
            "pdf_page": 16,
            "tamil": "லாயிரம் வேதம் அறிவொன்றே தெய்வம",
            "english": "thousands of Vedas, that knowledge alone is God,"
          },
          {
            "ordinal": 4,
            "kind": "lyric-line",
            "pdf_page": 16,
            "tamil": "எனக் கேளீரோ",
